- Checking in: circle fills with a 200ms scale-and-fade, the check icon draws in, the streak number counts up with a short tick animation, and the connector bar grows in from the left.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion: disable all of the above and use instant state changes.

## Accessibility and quality
- Fully keyboard operable with visible focus rings (2px accent outline, 2px offset).
- Semantic buttons, aria-live="polite" on the streak value, aria-labels on icon-only buttons.
- No horizontal overflow at 320px width.
- Support dark mode if the app already has it.

